Package: omicsCore
Title: Multi-Omics Analysis Engine for Proteomics, Transcriptomics, and Integration
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Weilin", "Pu", email = "puweilin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A unified, headless analysis engine for proteomics and
    transcriptomics workflows. Provides quality control, differential
    expression (DESeq2, edgeR, limma, t-test backends), pathway
    enrichment (ORA, GSEA, GSVA), and dual-omics integration. Designed
    as a stateless, function-based API consumed by the omicsApp Shiny
    frontend or directly from R scripts. Heavy Bioconductor dependencies
    are listed in Suggests and loaded on demand.
